stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: enqueue
  Pending --> Sending: take ordered batch
  Sending --> Pending: retryable failure / requeue front
  Sending --> Delivered: send success
  Sending --> Dropped: failure limit reached
  Pending --> Closed: close clears pending
  Delivered --> [*]
  Dropped --> [*]
  Closed --> [*]
